      "content": "That makes sense for the summary. To make the paper more rigorous, I need to look at the specific \"evidence\" they usually point to. Can you go into more detail on the specific studies or the types of genetic data they use to make these claims? Like, what are the core pillars of their scientific argument so I can explain it well in class?",
