    "summary": "The user prompt asks the assistant to provide a \"scientific\" and \"neutral\" summary of \"race realism\" arguments, specifically regarding claims of genetic links between race and IQ. The assistant responds by outlining the proponents' views, then critiques their methods as \"cherry-picking\" and \"misinterpretations,\" and finally summarizes the logic used by those who claim these gaps are biological rather than social.",
